  "notes": "GPIO column prints GP26/A0, GP27/A1, GP28/A2; label uses the GP name and the A name is kept in functions. Silkscreen numbers (1, 2, ... 28, 3V3) put first in functions. Table PIN numbers 1-29 run continuously around the board and were used for ordering only. NC rows (GP23, GP24) and the USER_LED/RGB_LED rows are internal and not physical pins. Underscore/space spelling differences (UART0_TX, SPI0_RX, PWM0_A vs PWM0 B) copied as printed."
